  "articleBody": "Before requesting a pantry remodeling estimate, measure the available area, list the items and appliances you need to store, photograph nearby walls and utilities, and decide whether you prefer a cabinet or walk-in solution. Share these details with the remodeling team so the design can address storage, clearances, finishes, electrical needs, and any permit-related work from the beginning.",
